        {
          "id": 2308783337,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Our current minimum version, is 3.16 (per https://doc.qt.io/qt-6/cmake-supported-cmake-versions.html)\n\nDebian Bullseye, for example, is 3.18. Ubuntu Focal (20.04) is 3.16, though we've already removed support for that by making Qt 5.15 required currently.\nEither the minimum required version needs to be bumped, or defer this and live with the warnings for now.",
