      "title": "cmake: fix Policy CMP0177 warnings",
      "message": "cmake: fix Policy CMP0177 warnings\n\nNew cmake versions warn that install() DESTINATION paths are normalized.\n\nThis is fixed by explictly normalizing the DESTINATION paths explicitly.\n",
